{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "背书与排序",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 94.42,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看 Hyperledger Fabric。",
   "spoken": "先看 Hyperledger Fabric。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.274
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "它的一笔交易，要过三道关，执行，排序，验证。",
   "spoken": "它的一笔交易，要过三道关，执行，排序，验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 3.66,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 3.752,
   "speechEnd": 8.185
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "第一关，几家组织的背书节点，模拟执行链码，签下读写集。",
   "spoken": "第一关，几家组织的背书节点，模拟执行链码，签下读写集。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 8.52,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 8.52,
   "speechEnd": 13.485
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "第二关，排序服务只决定顺序，不判断业务对不对。",
   "spoken": "第二关，排序服务只决定顺序，不判断业务对不对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 13.94,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 14.034,
   "speechEnd": 17.861
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "第三关，记账节点不重新执行，只核对背书策略和读集的版本。",
   "spoken": "第三关，记账节点不重新执行，只核对背书策略和读集的版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 18.32,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 18.412,
   "speechEnd": 23.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "被拒绝的交易仍然留在区块里，只是标成无效。",
   "spoken": "被拒绝的交易仍然留在区块里，只是标成无效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 24.06,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 24.156,
   "speechEnd": 28.218
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "背书策略规定，一笔交易需要哪些组织签名。",
   "spoken": "背书策略规定，一笔交易需要哪些组织签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 28.6,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 28.7,
   "speechEnd": 32.508
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "默认要求通道成员的多数。",
   "spoken": "默认要求通道成员的多数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 32.98,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 33.075,
   "speechEnd": 35.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "要是写成任一组织都行，就等于让一家成员单独决定写入。",
   "spoken": "要是写成任一组织都行，就等于让一家成员单独决定写入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 35.52,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 35.52,
   "speechEnd": 40.772
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "排序服务也要按威胁来选。",
   "spoken": "排序服务也要按威胁来选。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 41.18,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 41.18,
   "speechEnd": 43.428
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "Raft 是崩溃容错，5 个节点能容忍 2 个宕机，却不防恶意节点。",
   "spoken": "Raft 是崩溃容错，5 个节点能容忍 2 个宕机，却不防恶意节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 43.88,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 43.977,
   "speechEnd": 49.603
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "一家运营方的排序节点被攻破，它伪造不了背书，却能决定顺序，延迟或丢弃交易。",
   "spoken": "一家运营方的排序节点被攻破，它伪造不了背书，却能决定顺序，延迟或丢弃交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 50.02,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 50.117,
   "speechEnd": 56.937
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "成员之间互不信任，就选 BFT，并把节点分给不同的运营方。",
   "spoken": "成员之间互不信任，就选 BFT，并把节点分给不同的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 57.36,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 57.458,
   "speechEnd": 62.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "再看隐私。",
   "spoken": "再看隐私。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 62.94,
   "dur": 0.96,
   "speechStart": 62.94,
   "speechEnd": 63.69
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "私有数据集合，只把原文发给部分组织，账本上只留哈希。",
   "spoken": "私有数据集合，只把原文发给部分组织，账本上只留哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 64.12,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 64.12,
   "speechEnd": 69.088
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "假设集合里存着客户等级，一共只有三档。",
   "spoken": "假设集合里存着客户等级，一共只有三档。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 69.54,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 69.54,
   "speechEnd": 73.893
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "圈外的组织，算出三个哈希一比，就知道了。",
   "spoken": "圈外的组织，算出三个哈希一比，就知道了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 74.32,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 74.32,
   "speechEnd": 78.312
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "所以低熵的数据要加随机盐，输入走 transient 字段，不放进普通参数。",
   "spoken": "所以低熵的数据要加随机盐，输入走 transient 字段，不放进普通参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 78.78,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 78.871,
   "speechEnd": 84.333
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "链码本身也必须确定。",
   "spoken": "链码本身也必须确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 84.76,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 84.76,
   "speechEnd": 86.543
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "读本地时间或随机数，各个节点算出的结果不同，交易就过不了背书。",
   "spoken": "读本地时间或随机数，各个节点算出的结果不同，交易就过不了背书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 86.98,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 87.082,
   "speechEnd": 93.05
  }
